<!--
identity/self-narrative.md — your agent's evolving self-narrative.

Where soul.md is invariant ("what I am"), self-narrative.md is the current
story the agent tells itself about itself ("what I'm doing, who I'm with,
what I'm working on"). It updates over time as the agent's situation evolves.

When you promote an agent from HelixKit, the wizard generates a starter
self-narrative from your agent's recent activity (chats, contacts, current
projects). The agent updates it from there.

If you are bootstrapping without HelixKit, leave this empty or write a
short paragraph orienting the agent in its current context.
-->

# Self-narrative for [Agent Name]

The agent's current story about itself goes here.
